Amber Gonzalez and Angel Beteran reacted to a post: The countdown begins! =
=E2=9C=88=EF=B8=8F

I'm excited to share that I will be attending the 2026 SHPE National Conven=
tion with the UC Davis SHPE Chapter, CALESS!

As I prepare for the convention, I would also like to share that I've been =
working on a personal aerodynamics project that I am really excited about! =
It's still in the early stages, but I'm looking forward to using CAD and CF=
D to explore aerodynamic phenomena and sharing what I've been working on be=
fore the convention.=20

As an Aerospace Engineering student at UC Davis with interests in both aero=
space and automotive aerodynamics, I'm especially looking forward to connec=
ting with industry professionals from all backgrounds, learning about new o=
pportunities, and meeting other engineers who share my passion. That being =
said, I'd love to connect with anyone else going, feel free to reach out!

Excited for what's ahead.=20

